  "prefLabel": "Fis 402.09 Bob Houses",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 402.09 Bob Houses. In addition to the requirements of RSA 211:17-a relative to identification markings on any smelt shanty or bob house, each shanty or bob house shall be marked on the outside approximately halfway up on each side with 12 square inches of reflective material.\n\nSource. #8442, eff 1-1-06; ss by #10425, eff 1-1-14; ss by #13698, eff 7-26-23 (formerly Fis 402.10) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Fis 400)",
